sec-audio-intro-lead = Press play for a warm walkthrough of how Baylee handles passwords, memory, chats and pairing, or explore each animated diagram below.
sec-audio-intro-script = Welcome to Baylee security. Below, four quiet diagrams walk through how your account stays protected. When you sign in, OPAQUE keeps your password on your own device. In browser memory, temporary keys are overwritten promptly. Chat messages are sealed on your device before delivery, and client pairing lets your devices connect using a short confirmation code. Choose any diagram whenever you are ready.
